10][11].\n\n### **음악 철학**\n오희섭은 아이들의 순수한 목소리와 감성이 담긴 동요가 점차 사라지는 현실을 안타까워하며, 어린이들이 꾸밈없이 스스로의 감정을 노래할 수 있는 환경을 만드는 데 의무감을 느끼고 활동하는 것으로 알려져 있습니다[1]. 특히 어린이 합창단의 녹음 지도와 창작곡 편곡 등 동요 문화의 불씨를 살리기 위한 노력을 지속해 왔습니다[1][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [kookje.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpPgDcpgkqzi_K6l7LIx3YKV8ZKs4dJllq8bIbiancaya-mlhltLTH2-kPTdHfkkKK1Za1qvB771yut57Sv50cJ4QKQKOYwlxHW0Ht-MBP3TbrCNjMqyjGvuNS30WzFlp-iRMu69zHWCZSefM55OT3gNHpGAPNS_v0Ag-6gpnVYDhJvXUMcw==)\n[2] [ksilbo.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-V5VNs6wyBs3tIyRvItOPmRCqcA5IqFAwKPENmdDLMMuefO30j0k_cP4XII_PlW6xe6QDjno0s37e64RLHEchxECm7n-elREOaK0D4x4a9kl5jQtYrWxOmbDFSTzmHhM4IHhEkdZfW4bw65nXGQhddQ==)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEa6qMy2Xs45A4OCI8GDA51hZqr42kPqtf3VtRNf_6h_Q_o62T4n41-gm5WYH0UrDd-Lk3czRBZ_eZS9VbDg9yAl77UNNiAp7RuNMQGLJYAbvKESt3IPvhgDDmNp091hVzY)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFKy51i8KuhtTOTRUjPS3OTGULedeggP-QPWDWmg1PuOa43Vg7Tat48b0JhdHRIWwA9riVAcd6ak2gpuL73UNx8nMgLW923GgB0uRlwPItFlDBsJKJa0IjdUQAbx2uYyAkx)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFvC8P_9JcA0nCJ7klrAD48OnkyInz64tZrAwA98O-31GMBQH19KgggLW5uLiRHoX-g4-wwmaoBGTVfc2vFdhtCqBwMLFium8LDIk2d8so4Wo7Ga0CnIgxItCroMTwCkTWQ)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGNHSDaiZbOOIwuRWJBl1cBtvbaP2ms20qrhiSgYmQ_DMUpDas7NEer9LJtI1EwMTK4zn3Ev9yaU6GPXbk1YSOhILxuQ6DkYIciyhz8dMYMG571EAThs_0_jkDvBYAxktYu)\n[7] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHvnG0IgNxS35wn_uxibAxfP2JFScipQYP9imDlI8snlco2pT3VNgs2MVsEaAas3jYuw14fwVazkGxERi2UH-1H6_UVNmdPYwAz-ZdYhgIJXu4HEpHllatdKLHNba71LL30)\n[8] [daum.net](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFQ5yWU5SAJDN2uo6Cp62Z2eP_uZ-ilv1_PIeiJNWAgpJVhYdyerbHXN4fxB1cHsdA7_WOOhV